00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:45.910
Uh... Koushi-dono...

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:48.690
I'm sorry to disturb you at this hour.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:51.590
I'm so cold I can't go to sleep.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:57.110
My mind and body can no longer stay warm without you.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.740
Koushi-dono!

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:03.600
Please embrace me in your arms and lend me your warmth!

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.530
I refuse.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.920
Wha...!

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:16.620
It's not much, but I can feel Koushi-dono's warmth.

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:17.810
Nonsense.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.500
Moreover, do you know where my old man is?

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:25.820
Where did he go, without even explaining about the war of the twelve-something?

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:33.960
There are people I don't know who want to slaughter me, you know. So get off.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.260
About that... Koushi-dono...

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.960
I've heard about it from my dad.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:48.420
Including Kuzuryuu and Inuzuka, there are twelve deeply connected martial art families in Japan.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:54.070
I think they may have something to do with the war of the twelve shinshou.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:03:00.170
The assassins who are after Koushi-dono's life must be those dreadful martial artists!

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.050
Which means...

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:10.070
A dreadful martial artist

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:05.510
...there are others like her.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.340
What do I do...?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.260
Koushi-dono, let's train!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.110
To prepare for the attacks!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.550
Stop the nonsense, I'm just a normal person, I can't do martial arts.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.900
You can do it!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:19.860
Koushi-dono is the direct descendent of the Inuzuka family that practiced martial arts for generations!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:24.040
If you put your mind into it, any technique should be a piece of cake!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.570
It may not be much, but I will also help you out.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.450
Eh... first of all,

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:34.730
before you use a technique, you have to be like this...

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.680
Let your blood boil, and gather up all your ki.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:41.990
Then combine that ki with your mind...

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.250
Then in a single shot...!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.930
And that's it.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.200
That was scary... and she's waiting for praises.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:12.180
Caught in the Zoo

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:20.690
I would get more and more restless if I do nothing.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.030
Just study like I always do.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.620
I need to occupy my mind with things I enjoy.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:35.560
Pursuing knowledge like nothing is happening, even when his life is in danger.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.240
What determination!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.830
That's my Koushi-dono!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.920
Saigo-san went to the Zoo?

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.880
The zoo?

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.680
Are you serious?

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.210
Why did he go to the zoo?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.790
I don't know.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:56.150
But it's Saigo-san, the one who has reached the underworld we are talking about.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.580
I'm sure there is some deep meaning behind it.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.530
It's off the scale!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.020
That's our Saigo-san!

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:26.720
Koushi-dono...

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:29.170
We don't have school tomorrow.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.780
If you don't mind, can we go out?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.850
Like to the zoo?

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:35.760
No.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.000
Eh!?

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:42.120
Please! I want to go out with Koushi-dono!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.460
I said no.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.800
Inuzuka-kun, what happened?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.680
Oh. It's nothing.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:53.530
So don't worry about it.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.990
But Momoko-chan seems to be crying.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.790
Th... That's...

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.990
It's sweat, she's sweating.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:05.200
It sure is hot today.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.110
Inuzuka is the worst.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.710
I feel sorry for Momoko-chan.

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:13.480
I misjudged you.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.410
I'm going to the zoo with Koushi-dono tomorrow!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:25.560
I'll wake up earlier and make some bento for Koushi-dono!

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:28.730
I'll make sure Koushi-dono will like it this time.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.550
The bento of love...

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.110
The bento of love...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.820
If I can...

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:38.780
...make the bento of love...!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.870
Koushi-dono, it's the elephants, the elephants!

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:59.290
Did you know that the elephants are the biggest land mammals?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.130
They can eat over 150 kilograms of food in a day.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.320
Th... That much?

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:07.920
I can never eat that much.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.140
I can.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:10.810
Eh?

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.230
If it's the food that you made for me.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.230
Koushi-dono!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.510
It's delicious.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.440
Thank you!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.830
Wh... What are you doing?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:36.980
Momoko...

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.200
Koushi-dono...

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.620
What I want to eat is not your bento...

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.220
What I really wanted to eat is...

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.400
At a place like this...

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.550
People are watching.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:53.650
Momoko...

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:56.670
Yes...

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.280
N... No...

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.010
You can't...

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:10.070
That's too intense, Koushi-dono!

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.230
Koushi-dono!

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.670
Stop!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.620
Koushi-dono, it's the elephants, the elephants!

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:37.250
Koushi-dono, Koushi-dono, Koushi-dono, Koushi-dono!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.060
Settle down!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.900
Let's go, Koushi-dono!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.650
Hey...

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:49.480
What a carefree face.

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:57.460
Koushi-dono, look at that, look at that!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:58.710
It's a hippo!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:08:59.650
Yep, a hippo.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:01.080
It's a rhinoceros!

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:01.980
Yep, a rhinoceros.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.390
It's an American mountain gorilla!

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.840
Yep, an American mountain gorilla.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.830
Koushi-dono, it's a tiger!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:10.530
Really, a tiger.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:11.770
Tiger?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.030
Speaking of the twelve signs of the Chinese zodiac,

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:26.600
other than my dog and Momoko's dragon, there are ten clans that are after my life.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:28.970
The mouse feels weak, however.

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:32.440
Koushi-dono?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.880
I was gonna forget about it.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.370
Now all my worries are back.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.380
Let's go there this time!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:09.030
Koushi-dono! Let's do this together!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.420
Please help yourself.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.410
Yeah, it's great.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:39.640
Huh?

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:45.240
What? Do I have food on my face?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.680
N... No...

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:08.770
It's a little different from my dream, but Koushi-dono is really enjoying my bento of love.

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.140
K... Koushi-dono!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:20.710
Are... Are we having a date?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.180
No, not at all.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.550
N... No way!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.070
A holiday, the zoo, and the bento of love!

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.630
Doesn't this look like a date between a couple?

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:33.210
No. An representation of our relationship would be...

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:34.110
...that.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.880
Our relationship...

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.890
A couple! Just as I thought!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:56.470
Th... This guy is...

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:59.630
It's the rabbit I fed earlier.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.590
Why is he here?

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.470
Did he run away?

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.910
P... Penguins...

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.400
These are... koalas.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.850
What is going on here?

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.910
K... Koushi-dono! Look there!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.050
Th... This is...

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.570
The animals... are escaping.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.640
This is so exciting.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:54.370
Things are just getting started.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.370
Inuzuka Koushi...

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.810
This place will be your grave!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.480
It's dangerous to stay here.

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.970
Let's hurry and get out of here.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.640
Koushi-dono, look at that!

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:16.540
What's wrong?

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:21.400
Damn the monkeys.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:22.720
Get away!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:25.620
Are you hurt?

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.570
You are fine, right?

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:28.930
Don't cry.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.510
It's alright now.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.140
I said don't cry.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.230
Animals can't match humans.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.220
Really?

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.800
Of course, animals are not scary at all.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.380
Animals are not scary at all.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.410
H... Hey, we should run too.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:03.830
Huh?

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:07.030
Don't! Even if it's you...

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:11.390
The opponent is a polar bear, you know! It's the world's strongest carnivore!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.460
It eats seals and reindeers!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.290
I think I can do it.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:19.150
It may be the first time I'm facing a polar bear.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:24.380
But I've defeated brown bears during my trainings when I was nine.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.190
39 of them.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:30.070
I... I see...

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:36.950
If we leave him like this, he will attack other people.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.500
I can't leave him here.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:41.130
I'll try to persuade him to stop the rage!

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:42.450
Persuade? How do you...

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:58.110
What's with that bear's movement?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:03.160
The speed is abnormal, is that really a polar bear?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.390
I gave him some special medicine.

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:11.700
Not only has his strength improved, it also stimulated his nervous system.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.060
It has made him to go on a rage.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.290
It's our clan's secret medicine!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.080
Stop the rage.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.510
You... You are not hurt at all?

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.690
She's unbelievably strong.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.950
At this rate, Inuzuka's assassination...

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.280
This kind of resistance is within my expectation.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.800
I have prepared the next step in our plan.

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.340
I see.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.080
We still have that.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.970
Now do you see the difference between us?

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.190
Stop the rage!

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.260
Return to your home!

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.500
What's happening to him all of a sudden?

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.010
What happened?

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:35.050
This secret medicine has 500 times the concentration.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:39.910
He has obtained the strength no one can compete with!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.180
Even that muscular dragon woman will not be able to beat him.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.210
Koushi-dono!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.470
How dare you hurt Koushi-dono...

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.130
Good job, my servant, the invincible beast!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:30.880
Finish Inuzuka Koushi next!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.570
Shit...

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.090
That's more like a monster than a bear...

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.710
Even she was easily blown away.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.670
What is...

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.630
You gotta be kidding...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.070
Even with her strength...

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.170
Wh... What did I ever do to you!?

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.960
We did it! It's the end of Inuzuka Koushi!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.290
N... No way!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.130
Damn that dragon woman...

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.010
Didn't I tell you to stop the rage?

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.000
If you still don't understand...

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.950
...then I must show you a little of my true strength!

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:06.910
Sh... Shit!

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.720
Haira Ichiden Musou style, ultimate technique!

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:20.540
Shout Bazooka Strike!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.160
Stop the...!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.490
...rage.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.490
H... Hey, now is your chance.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.790
Finish him off with your ultimate technique.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.630
I think he has finally understood.

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:15.800
He... He's coming! Hurry up and use your technique!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:21.900
Now he's all over her...

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.600
You are amazing.

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:27.100
He wants to thank you too.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:28.910
I don't need it.

